    "sub_name": "文學與文化創意",
    "sub_ename": "LITERATURE AND CULTURE CREATIVITY",
    "describe_ch": "培養學生從閱讀文學中開發出文化創意的相關能力。學生們學習細讀文學作品，而以藝術創作的表達方式來深度詮釋文學，並開發出與生活美學相關的作品。",
    "describe_eh": "To train students' abilities to read literary works with a cultural sensitivity which connects literary works to our real life experiences.\r\nStudents are expected to design some aesthetic works to relate and to respond to their literature reading.\r\n",
